<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BureauOS — You're in</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #1e293b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }

        .header {
            padding: 40px 0 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 140px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .footer-tagline {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .tagline {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .tagline svg {
            margin-right: 6px;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">

        <!-- HEADER — reusable frame, styled in <head> -->
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://www.bureauos.space/logo.png" alt="BureauOS Logo" class="logo">
        </div>

        <!-- CONTENT — all styles inlined -->
        <div style="padding: 0 48px 40px; text-align: center;">

            {{{content}}}

            <div
                style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-top: 32px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
                    Actively structuring a business or supporting one? Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@bureauos.space"
                        style="color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">hello@bureauos.space</a>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 32px;">
                <a href="https://www.bureauos.space/"
                    style="display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #1e293b; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">Visit
                    BureauOS &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FOOTER — reusable frame, styled in <head> -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="footer-brand">BureauOS</div>
            <div class="footer-tagline">Compliance infrastructure for cross-border businesses</div>
            <a href="#" class="tagline">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path
                        d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z" />
                    <path d="M5 3v4" />
                    <path d="M19 17v4" />
                    <path d="M3 5h4" />
                    <path d="M17 19h4" />
                </svg>
                Businesses don’t fail because of product — they fail because of structure </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>